    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n61 Barton Road East is a stunning Energy B-rated, semi detached residence finished to an impeccable standard throughout its 133 Sq Mt /1,431 Sq Ft of spacious accommodation. Designed with flair and attention to detail, the interiors showcase a timeless, contemporary style. \nSet back from the road, number 61 has elegant finishes, offering exceptional comfort, natural light, and versatility. \n\nThe bright entrance hallway sets the tone with timber flooring and cleverly concealed understairs storage and guest w.c. To the front lies a peaceful living room with a bespoke solid fuel burner and built in shelving units, while the rear of the house opens into a superbly designed open-plan family space comprising a large kitchen and dining area with bifold doors leading out to the stunning South facing garden. The kitchen features an expansive range of fitted units, and appliances, opening through to a cleverly designed utility area running the length of the house giving access from the front to rear gardens. There is the all-important additional reception room to the front currently used as a family room / office space with a large utility room off. \n\nOn the first floor, there are three bedrooms a large double to the rear with built in wardrobes and views of the mountains. A large double and single are to the front both with built in storage and the family bathroom completes the accommodation at this level. \n\nA particular highlight of this home is its glorious south-facing rear garden, which benefits from all-day sunshine and a sweeping view of the Dublin Mountains. Designed for both relaxation and entertaining, the garden includes an extensive patio area and a manicured lawn, bordered by mature planting and ideal for outdoor living. There is plenty of storage with a block built shed. The front garden is landscaped with granite-block bordered gravel, mature hedging, and a path leading to the front door, with off-street parking and an installed EV charging point.\n\nThe location is another key asset, positioned equidistant from the highly sought-after villages of Churchtown and Dundrum. A wealth of local amenities are within walking distance, including a choice of primary and secondary schools, sports clubs, shopping centres, cafés, and restaurants. Excellent public transport links are close by, with the LUAS at Windy Arbour and several Dublin Bus routes providing easy access to the city centre. The M50 is also within easy reach. 61 Barton Road East offers an outstanding opportunity to acquire a modern, turnkey home in a mature, family-friendly neighbourhood with every convenience on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.80m x 2.11m\nEntrance hallway with tiled inset. Laminate flooring, smart storage.\n\nW.C - \nWith tiled surround. wash hand basin and wc.\n\nLiving Room - 3.59m x 3.78m\nLaminate floor and Stillorgan Stove fuel burner. Fitted shelving. Leads plan to;\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 3.91m x 8.11m\nLaminate flooring, plenty of dining space, excellent range of wall and floor level units incorporating double oven and 5 ring gas hob, dishwasher, sink unit. Two windows provide great light. Door leads to side utility and storage area and in turn to front and rear gardens. Bi-folding doors open out to rear gardens.\n\nStudy - 3.42m x 2.60m\nWith laminate flooring and window overlooking front. Access into Utility Room.\n\nUtility Room - 1.93m x 2.68m\n\n\nLean-To - 7.38m x 1.98m\n\n\nStore - 1.87m x 1.98m\n\n\nLanding - 3.19m x 2.30m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.93m x 3.64m\nLarge Double with treated timber floorboards. Skon Wardrobes. Beautiful views over the Dublin Mountains.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.57m x 3.64m\nLarge Double with Skon wardrobes and timber floorboards. Over front\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.37m x 2.66m\nLarge Single with built in Bspace bed unit, shelving and storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.73m x 2.30m\nLarge family bathroom, tiled wall and flooring with walk in shower unit, full bath, w.c and wash hand basin.\n\n"
      },
